<title>NETHERLANDS: Nedlloyd 1996 results breakdown.</title>
<headline>Nedlloyd 1996 results breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nedlloyd 1996 results breakdown by business sector:</p>
<p>TURNOVER (billions of guilders)</p>
<p>   - Ocean shipping			   2.97  vs  3.02</p>
<p>   - European transport/distribution    3.70  vs  3.49</p>
<p>   - Other activities (millions)	164.0   vs 254.0</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT (millions of guilders)</p>
<p>    - Ocean shipping			    25  vs   57</p>
<p>    - European transport/distribution     52  vs   47</p>
<p>    - Other activities			  27  vs   34</p>
<p>    - Non-consolidated companies	    62  vs   71</p>
